          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simeyona hakuyikiswila nkisu, hakumwila mama yindi Mariya nindi, Tiya, iwu mwana anamutoŋoli dehi kwikala wakudimbwisha niwakuhindwisha aIsarela amavulu; kulonda akekali chinjikijilu chakutenawu chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.34",
