              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋi nawa kaprofwetu wamumbanda Ana, mwana kaFwanuweli, wakumuza waAsheri; wadiŋi wasweja dehi kukula, kufuma hasumbukiliyi washakamini nanfumwindi nyaka yitanu nayiyedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.36",
