              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimunahiti mafuku asatu hiyakumuwana mutembeli, nashakami mukachi kawankuluŋaŋa nakutiya nikuyihujola.",
          "type": "text",
